(text "Miata ECU motherboard 1999-2000 (NB1). Carries the year-specific harness header and the year-independent I/O (wideband, MAP, IAT, USB-C). All engine control is on the daughterboard." (at 30.48 100.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2bb001ff-1c32-436b-884c-25a83bfcf646)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))